WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.066 --> 00:00:00.467
[dramatic music]

00:00:03.236 --> 00:00:10.710
♪ ♪

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:33.233
- OKAY, MAN, YOU KNOW WHAT?
IT WASN'T MY FAULT, ALL RIGHT?

00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:35.568
I-I-I-I HAD THE MONEY
LIKE YOU SAID

00:00:35.735 --> 00:00:37.003
IN A TRASH BAG
IN THE BACK OF MY CAR,

00:00:37.170 --> 00:00:38.938
AND I WAS GONNA GO

00:00:39.105 --> 00:00:40.940
STRAIGHT TO THE DROP SPOT.

00:00:41.107 --> 00:00:43.410
ALL RIGHT?

00:00:49.549 --> 00:00:50.450
NO, NO--HOL--OKAY.

00:00:50.617 --> 00:00:52.318
OKAY, OKAY.

00:00:52.485 --> 00:00:54.354
OKAY, NO--NO, HEY,
HEY, HEY, HEY, MAN.

00:00:54.521 --> 00:00:56.289
THERE AIN'T NO NEED FOR YOU
TO GET COMFORTABLE.

00:00:56.456 --> 00:00:59.025
OKAY? BECAUSE--BECAUSE
I'M TELLING YOU, MAN.

00:00:59.192 --> 00:01:01.061
WHAT HAPPENED
WASN'T MY FAULT, ALL RIGHT?

00:01:01.227 --> 00:01:03.596
I-I-I-I-I-I DROVE TO
THE AGREED UPON LOCATION, MAN.

00:01:03.763 --> 00:01:07.000
OH--OH, MAN.

00:01:07.167 --> 00:01:08.234
WHAT?

00:01:08.401 --> 00:01:09.469
OKAY--OKAY, OKAY!

00:01:09.636 --> 00:01:12.172
OKAY, BEC--BEC--OKAY.

00:01:12.338 --> 00:01:14.974
BECAUSE THERE'S NO NEED
TO HAVE ANYTHING CRAZY

00:01:15.141 --> 00:01:16.109
IN A PAPER BAG.

00:01:16.276 --> 00:01:18.011
I'M TELLING YOU.

00:01:18.178 --> 00:01:19.779
THERE'S AN EXPLANATION
FOR WHAT WENT DOWN!

00:01:19.946 --> 00:01:22.515
WHOA! WHOA!
WHOA! WHOA! OKAY!

00:01:22.682 --> 00:01:24.684
LET'S CALM DOWN NOW.

00:01:24.851 --> 00:01:26.252
LET'S CALM DOWN, MAN.

00:01:26.419 --> 00:01:27.987
THERE AIN'T NO NEED.

00:01:28.154 --> 00:01:31.691
OH, A JUICE BOX?

00:01:31.858 --> 00:01:33.426
THERE AIN'T NO NEED
TO EAT A MEAL

00:01:33.593 --> 00:01:35.895
AND THEN DO
SOME CRAZY [bleep]

00:01:36.062 --> 00:01:37.964
WITH THE PLASTIC
SANDWICH CONTAINER!

00:01:38.131 --> 00:01:41.167
OH, MAN, COME ON.

00:01:41.334 --> 00:01:44.237
COME ON, MAN.
JUST CHILL OUT A LITTLE BIT.

00:01:44.404 --> 00:01:46.039
JUST--YOU NEED
TO RELAX, MAN.

00:01:46.206 --> 00:01:47.674
YOU NEED TO
TAKE IT EASY AND RELA--

00:01:47.841 --> 00:01:49.642
OH, [bleep]!
OH, GODDAMN!

00:01:49.809 --> 00:01:52.612
NOW, COME ON, MAN!
DON'T DO IT, DON'T DO IT!

00:01:52.779 --> 00:01:54.814
DON'T DO IT, MAN! YOU SH--
COME ON, MAN.

00:01:54.981 --> 00:01:56.382
OH, YOU'RE EATING THE SANDWICH!
YOU'RE EATING THE SANDWICH.

00:01:56.549 --> 00:01:58.451
[sobbing]

00:01:58.618 --> 00:02:00.420
OH, MAN, HOW YOU GONNA
SANDWICH ME, DOG?

00:02:00.587 --> 00:02:03.556
HOW YOU GONNA SANDWICH ME?
OH, [bleep]!

00:02:03.723 --> 00:02:06.326
OKAY, LOOK,
IT'S GETTIN' CRAZY NOW!

00:02:06.493 --> 00:02:08.895
IT'S GOTTA STOP!
IT'S GOTTA STOP RIGHT NOW, OKAY?

00:02:09.062 --> 00:02:10.597
YOU CLEANIN' YOURSELF UP BEFORE
YOU DO SOME ILL [bleep]?

00:02:10.763 --> 00:02:12.398
COME ON, MAN!

00:02:12.565 --> 00:02:14.467
WHAT YOU DOIN'?
WHAT YOU WANNA KNOW?

00:02:14.634 --> 00:02:16.469
WHAT--I'LL TELL YOU
WHATEVER YOU WANNA KNOW, MAN!

00:02:16.636 --> 00:02:18.171
JUST PLEASE STOP
THIS COLD-ASS [bleep], MAN!

00:02:18.338 --> 00:02:20.006
I'M BEGGIN' YOU,
DOG, PLEASE.

00:02:20.173 --> 00:02:22.075
OH, [bleep]! NO! NO, OKAY!

00:02:22.242 --> 00:02:24.144
LOOK, OKAY, MAY--MAYBE IT WAS
MY FAULT A LITTLE BIT.

00:02:24.310 --> 00:02:26.112
MAYBE IT WAS MY FAULT
A LITTLE BIT, BUT DON'T JUST--

00:02:26.279 --> 00:02:27.914
WHAT YOU GONNA DO
WITH THAT JUICE BOX, MAN?

00:02:28.081 --> 00:02:29.749
WHAT'RE YOU GONNA
DO WITH THAT J--

00:02:29.916 --> 00:02:31.451
WHAT'RE YOU GONNA
DO WITH THE STRAW?

00:02:31.618 --> 00:02:33.219 line:91%
WHAT'RE YOU GONNA
DO WITH THE STRAW?

00:02:33.386 --> 00:02:35.388
COME ON, MAN, DO--
LISTEN, LISTEN.

00:02:35.555 --> 00:02:36.689
NO, NO. NO, I DID IT! I DID IT!
I DID IT, OKAY? I DID IT!

00:02:36.856 --> 00:02:37.991
I DID IT, I LEFT THE CAR!

00:02:38.158 --> 00:02:39.926
I LEFT FOR THREE MINUTES!

00:02:40.093 --> 00:02:41.194
SO PLEASE DON'T DO ANYTHING
WITH THE STRAW!

00:02:41.361 --> 00:02:42.262
WHY AREN'T YOU STOPPING?

00:02:42.428 --> 00:02:43.730
FINE! FINE!

00:02:43.897 --> 00:02:44.764
AAH!
[screams]

00:02:44.931 --> 00:02:45.798
AAH! MAN!

00:02:45.965 --> 00:02:47.100
OKAY, MAN!

00:02:47.267 --> 00:02:48.935
HA, HA! I BEAT YOU TO IT!

00:02:49.102 --> 00:02:51.871
OKAY? I GOT YOUR POINT,
ALL RIGHT, MAN?

00:02:52.038 --> 00:02:53.139
HA!

00:02:53.306 --> 00:02:56.776
OH, MAN, THAT'S A BITCH!

00:02:56.943 --> 00:02:59.412
[muffled screaming]

00:03:01.080 --> 00:03:02.549
[beeping]

00:03:08.254 --> 00:03:10.723
- WILL WE BE HAVING ANY MORE
PROBLEMS OUT OF HIM, SIR?

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.459
- [tiny voice]
NO.

00:03:13.626 --> 00:03:16.829
- YEAH. THAT'S WHAT
I'M TALKIN' ABOUT.

